{"path":"container/inplace_vector/capacity","title":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::capacity","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::inplace_vector&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>capacity","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/capacity","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the capacity of the internal (inplace) storage. Equivalent to: return N;.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> size_type capacity<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the capacity of the internal (inplace) storage. Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> N<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The maximum number of elements the container is able to hold.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Because each <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span> is a fixed-capacity container, the value returned by <code>capacity</code> equals <code>N</code> (which is also the value returned by <span class=\"t-lc\">max_size()</span>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;inplace_vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v1<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>v1.<span class=\"me1\">capacity</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> v1.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>v2.<span class=\"me1\">capacity</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> v2.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/max_size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>max_size</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the maximum possible number of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/resize\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>resize</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  changes the number of elements stored <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/empty\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>empty</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether the container  is empty <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/reserve\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reserve</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  reserves storage <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/inplace_vector","title":"std::inplace_vector"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::capacity","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++26. Returns the capacity of the internal (inplace) storage. Equivalent to: return N;."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The maximum number of elements the container is able to hold."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Because each std::inplace_vector<T, N> is a fixed-capacity container, the value returned by capacity equals N (which is also the value returned by max_size())."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"max_size","note":"returns the maximum possible number of elements"},{"label":"size","note":"returns the number of elements"},{"label":"resize","note":"changes the number of elements stored"},{"label":"empty","note":"checks whether the container is empty"},{"label":"reserve","note":"reserves storage"}]}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":139,"codeBlockCount":1}
